WEBVTT

00:00:00.200 --> 00:00:05.140
Connect story events with prior knowledge; identify the main idea, compare events and

00:00:05.140 --> 00:00:06.280
infer a moral.

00:00:07.117 --> 00:00:11.997
Kojo lost a book, searched his bag, then found it in class. What happened first?

00:00:11.997 --> 00:00:13.623
Answer: Kojo lost the book.

00:00:14.450 --> 00:00:19.037
Read a short story aloud and explain which event is most important and why.

00:00:19.867 --> 00:00:22.277
Discuss why: The loss starts the sequence.
